## Lessons Learned

### Correlation Improves Context

A remote network logon or PowerShell event independently may represent legitimate activity.

Their temporal relationship provides significantly more investigative value.

### Threat Hunts and Detections Complement Each Other

The same activity could be identified using:

```text
Automated Correlation
+
Analyst Threat Hunting
```

### Evidence Gaps Must Be Documented

Known limitations involving Event ID 4698 should remain part of the incident record rather than being hidden.

### Authorized Activity Can Still Be a True Positive

The monitoring logic correctly identified the generated behavior even though the behavior was intentional.

